                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Realized I didn't like it just after the refund period was over. It's a nice way to test your vocabulary, but sadly the game doesn't award you for finding long or complicate words that allows you to cover a big part of the grid. Most of the time a lot of small and simple words is the way to go. Although the game says that the combination given in the hints is not the only one possible, filling an entire grid except one tile, then changing words 10 times, without ever being able to finish the grid, makes the experience frustrating. Spending time to solve a puzzle is fun, but spending time looking for the exact correct word among 100 possibilities is not.",
